# importou-domain

- **Sem Tenant.** Boundary = `Organization` + `Membership` + `Role`.
- JWT: `{ sub: userId, membershipId }`.
- Roles: `admin` | `importer` | `exporter` | `broker` (compatíveis com `organization.type`).
- Compliance na **Organization** (importer RADAR; broker KYB light; exporter `foreignTaxId`).
- Operação: `ImportOperation.referenceCode` tipo `IMP-*`; filhos quote / landed cost / broker proposal.
- Package manager: **Yarn** only.
- Commits: English Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, …).
- Integrações atrás de ports em `infra/gateways` (Pay, KYB, Radar) — stubs até o loop estabilizar.
- Features: `app/tasks/prd-<slug>/` with `prd.md` + `techspec.md` + `N_task.md`.
- Prefer Importou modules and examples (`import-operation`, `organization`, `membership`). Do not copy patterns from unrelated products.
- Estilo Nest/CQRS/API: referência técnica = BlockBR — ver `block-technical-reference.mdc` (auth authenticate/authorize + user/me).

$END$
